  "description": "Roslyn analyzers for a no-comments code style: DLZ0001 bans line/block comments, DLZ0002 allows doc comments only on public/protected members, DLZ0003 caps a doc comment at 3 lines of summary/param/returns, DLZ0004 requires Method_Scenario_Expected test names, DLZ0005 reports types in Services/Helpers/Utils/Utilities/Common namespaces, DLZ0006-DLZ0015 enforce the house patterns (IHttpClientFactory, IOptions, declared authorization, IMemoryCache, justified suppressions, architecture style, records for DTOs/commands/events, services injected not constructed, RESTful routes, only repositories touch the database). Brings Meziantou.Analyzer, Microsoft.VisualStudio.Threading.Analyzers and SonarAnalyzer.CSharp as warnings that never fail a TreatWarningsAsErrors build. Ships Meziantou.Analyzer, Microsoft.VisualStudio.Threading.Analyzers and SonarAnalyzer.CSharp as warnings; pack IDs and DLZ0001-DLZ0005, DLZ0012, DLZ0013, DLZ0014, DLZ0015 are in WarningsNotAsErrors.",
